From: Elad Fernandes <elad.fernandes@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Apr 2021 15:37:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-8523: Changing the qos destroy tree debugfs API to a
 write access only

---
 .../net/ppv4/pp-api/pp-qos-mgr/pp_qos_debugfs.c    | 32 ++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ppv4/pp-api/pp-qos-mgr/pp_qos_debugfs.c b/drivers/net/ppv4/pp-api/pp-qos-mgr/pp_qos_debugfs.c
